+| `F3_PIPD_DESIGN` | NORMATIVE | R1 | PIPD-LS-SP design set (blueprint + packages) | see §2 | `73253c8b3cda60c1e14e810ac6874192b069c4a6d2e830673711152cc3762e5b` | `知識庫/…/PIPD/` (skeleton, `PIPD-LS-SP_PIPD-PKG/`, `PIPD-LS-SP_藍圖/`) |
