+* **8 skills** (`skills/pipd-*`): `pipd-route-intake`, `pipd-authority-source`, `pipd-pi-compile`,
+  `pipd-pd-bind`, `pipd-profile-tailor`, `pipd-execution-contract`, `pipd-assurance-tqaep`,
