+| `PIPD-LS-SP_藍圖.md` | PIPD-LS-SP design | design set (F3) | `a751a9e91dc6d0b7914b0598519e5d7a0f7adaccb6704e9c7d2aa503f80b0d68` | `PIPD-LS-SP_藍圖/PIPD-LS-SP_藍圖.md` |
