## Honest limits (also in the receipt)

Two things worth flagging rather than burying:

The replay determinism is a **per-root** claim. `bind-pd` derives the `RepoContext` from the actual host directory, and the root path sits inside the hashed `RepoContext`, so a different `--root` yields the same PI/ECP/TQAEP digests but a different PD digest. I stated it that way instead of overclaiming.

`compile-construction-contract` is not one of the 13 CLI verbs, so it is driven via the pipeline API in the unit test and named explicitly as a NOT_RUN CLI item — not skipped silently.

All disposable roots outside the repo were removed; no file outside the admitted write scope was touched. Candidate-only: no commit, push, tag or release.
